Structure point: Field x as integer. Field y as integer. End structure. Structure line: Field start as structure point. Field samples as array of integer with length 2. End structure. Structure node: Field value as integer. Field next as pointer to structure node. End structure. Declare p as structure point. Set member x of p to 10. Set member y of p to 20. Say Member x of p. Say Member y of p. Declare pp as pointer to structure point with value Address of p. Set member x of pp to 11. Say Member x of p. Declare l as structure line. Set member start of l to p. Set element at 0 in Member samples of l to 4. Set element at 1 in Member samples of l to 5. Say Member x of Member start of l. Say Element at 1 in Member samples of l. Say Size of type structure point is equal to Size of p. Declare n as structure node. Set member value of n to 7. Say Member value of n. Procedure copy takes input as structure point returns structure point: Return input. End procedure. Declare copied as structure point with value Call copy with p done. Say Member x of copied.
